  "display_title": "Save It for the Honeymoon",
  "description": "Mo-A never thought much of her cold, stern boss, Geon-Hu. At least, not until that fateful incident at the company workshop. Ever since accidentally seeing him in the buff, Mo-A can’t get him off her mind. After weeks of fantasizing, she finally asks if he’d like to spend the night with her. That’s when he drops a bomb: he’s a virgin, and he’ll only sleep with her if she marries him. The problem is, Mo-A doesn’t believe in marriage! With such different values, will these two make it down the aisle? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
